window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I was his even before he hunted me down.</b><br> <br> When Wilder Blackwell bent me over the railing of his private balcony and made me scream his name into the night, I thought he was just the ruthlessly sexy billionaire who already claimed me in the back of his limo.<br> <br> Not the stalker who would kill any man who touches me.<br> <br> Or the brute who hunted me down and spanked my bare a-- as I writhed and begged.<br> <br> But by the time he carried me off, I knew he was all three.<br> <br> And that just made me come harder for him.</p> <p><b>Publisher's Note:</b> <i>Stalker</i> is the third book in the <i>Legacy of Kings</i> series but can be listened to as a standalone. It includes spankings and rough, intense sexual scenes. If such material offends you, please don't buy this book.</p>"; 
